      {- 2}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack\,$, $\textbf{a} = ~\begin{bmatrix}
      0 \\
      0 \\
      8
      \end{bmatrix}\,$, and $\textbf{b} = ~\left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
      .9 \\
      2.0 \\
      {- 3.7}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack\,$.﻿
